WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.601
-Right now, guys,
it is time to look at

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:03.767
the stories making headlines
today

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:05.501
and weigh the good with the bad.

00:00:05.501 --> 00:00:07.601
It's time for "Pros and Cons."
Here we go.

00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:11.801
-♪ Pros and cons
and pros and cons and pros ♪

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:13.100
[ Cheer and applause ]

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.701
-Tonight, we'll be taking a look
at the pros and cons

00:00:15.701 --> 00:00:18.534
of Biden's first year in office.

00:00:18.534 --> 00:00:20.734
He just finished up
his first year as president.

00:00:20.734 --> 00:00:22.234
A lot has happened in that time.

00:00:22.234 --> 00:00:24.033
So let's look at
the pros and cons of

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:25.767
Biden's first year in office.

00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:27.534
Here we go. Pro --

00:00:27.534 --> 00:00:30.334
over 200 million Americans
were vaccinated.

00:00:30.334 --> 00:00:32.934
Con -- They were all in front of
you in line at CVS.

00:00:32.934 --> 00:00:35.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:38.400
"Let's try the self-checkout."

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.334
Pro -- His swearing-in ceremony
was a year ago.

00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:43.567
Con -- His swearing-at ceremony
was yesterday.

00:00:43.567 --> 00:00:45.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:45.234 --> 00:00:47.734
"Stupid s--"

00:00:47.734 --> 00:00:50.067
-Peter Douchey.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.067 --> 00:00:51.901
-It's Doocy.
-Oh, it's not -- It's Doocy?

00:00:51.901 --> 00:00:54.334
-Yeah, that's correct.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:57.701
Pro -- Hospital deaths caused by
omicron are plummeting.

00:00:57.701 --> 00:01:01.033
Con -- TV deaths caused by
Peloton are skyrocketing.

00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:02.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:04.334
This guy died --
What's going on?

00:01:04.334 --> 00:01:05.400
-Come on!

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.701
-There's got to be
other ways to die.

00:01:07.701 --> 00:01:10.534
Pro -- He wants to create
a lasting legacy.

00:01:10.534 --> 00:01:13.167
Con -- Or at least make "Biden"
a Wordle answer.

00:01:13.167 --> 00:01:17.634
[ Laughter ]
That's cool.

00:01:17.634 --> 00:01:20.801
Pro -- He got Tom Hanks
to do a pro-America PSA.

00:01:20.801 --> 00:01:23.868
Con -- He got Wilson
the volleyball to run the CDC.

00:01:23.868 --> 00:01:26.234
[ Laughter ]
Is that what's happening?

00:01:26.234 --> 00:01:28.667
-Yeah. Why would you do that?

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:31.234
-Pro -- He went after
the insurance companies.

00:01:31.234 --> 00:01:34.033
Con -- He called the Geico gecko
a stupid son of a --

00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:36.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:38.167
Why?

00:01:38.167 --> 00:01:39.734
-Why would he do that?
-Why?

00:01:39.734 --> 00:01:42.534
Pro -- Biden has forgiven
more than $13 billion

00:01:42.534 --> 00:01:46.100
in student loan debt.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.868
Con -- Which should cover the
price of about three textbooks.

00:01:48.868 --> 00:01:52.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:53.000
$2.
-What?

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.534
Not even enough for a beer.

00:01:54.534 --> 00:01:56.868
-I paid 400 bucks
for each one of these.

00:01:56.868 --> 00:01:59.067
Yeah, at least get me a beer,
man.

00:01:59.067 --> 00:02:01.467
Pro -- Biden turned 79.

00:02:01.467 --> 00:02:03.300
Con -- Which explains why
his approval rating

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:04.801
has fallen and it can't get up.

00:02:04.801 --> 00:02:06.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:06.868 --> 00:02:10.834
-Oy! Clap on.

00:02:10.834 --> 00:02:13.367
Pro -- Biden is hoping to
improve his image this year.

00:02:13.367 --> 00:02:15.434
Con -- Which explains
his new Cabinet members,

00:02:15.434 --> 00:02:17.834
Jonathan, Bobby, Tan,
Antoni and Karamo.

00:02:17.834 --> 00:02:21.167
Wow!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:21.167 --> 00:02:23.133
And finally, pro --
People wonder if Biden

00:02:23.133 --> 00:02:25.100
is getting too old
for another term.

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:26.601
Con -- Even Tom Brady is like,

00:02:26.601 --> 00:02:27.968
"Got to know when
to pack it in, bro."

00:02:27.968 --> 00:02:30.133
There you have it.
Those are the "Pros and Cons."

